{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13132","headline":"沣水送郑鄠县读书 · 皇甫冉","name":"沣水送郑鄠县读书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"麦秋中夏凉风起，送君西郊及沣水。\n孤烟远树动离心，隔岸江流若千里。\n早年江海谢浮名，此路云山惬尔情。\n上古全经皆在口，秦人如见济南生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13132.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13132","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}